"Fix indexing and query parsing issues" --body "Summary:\n- Fix parsing to preserve trailing characters after query\n- Restore notation support by correcting required file loading in cli/lambdapi.ml\n- Add position info to query command error messages\n- Prevent websearch from returning pages on syntax errors\n- Restore streaming of search results\n- Use uniform types for query formatting functions and remove dual syntax-tree/string acceptance\n\nDetails:\nThis branch implements several minor fixes after the indexing_BO merge, focused on search indexing and query handling. It ensures query parsing is handled in the right phase, improves CLI error reporting, and prevents incorrect search results when syntax errors occur.\n\nSee TODO.md for related tasks and remaining index/search enhancement ideas.